<title>USA: Reading names Robert Smerling president.</title>
<headline>Reading names Robert Smerling president.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reading Entertainment Inc said Monday its board of directors appointed Robert Smerling as president of the company.  </p>
<p>The company said Smerling, former president of Loews Theaters, a subsidiary of Sony Corp, will replace Craig Tompkins.</p>
<p>It said it had named Tompkins to the post of vice-chairman of Reading Entertainment.</p>
<p>Tompkins will nevertheless keep his position as president of Craig Corp, Reading's principal shareholder, it said.</p>
</text>
